+	 *          CLONE_SETTLS) with its own stack and a new thread pointer.
+	 *
+	 * `rd12` is loaded with a sentinel the program never writes again: the
+	 * child's frame must be the parent's *copy*, so the same value has to
+	 * come back at the child's first trap (contract-syscall §11「子现场 =
+	 * 父现场副本」). */
